  "display_title": "My Far Too Tumultuous Marriage",
  "description": "Finding love is the last thing on So-Ran’s mind. She’s busy trying to juggle a legal career and figuring out a way to pay off the debt she owes her stalker ex-boyfriend. All she wants is to move on and find peace, so when an unexpected opportunity presents itself, she seizes it. A fake marriage to Kang-Ho Baek, a mysterious but successful businessman, sounds like the perfect solution to her problems. But what she doesn’t anticipate is falling in love with him. What happens when a marriage of convenience turns into something more?\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
